  "interview_decisions_verified": [
    "Batch image enhancements create independent named versions; single-document AI edits immediately add layers.",
    "Native documents and layered PSD/PSB import/export with compatibility reports.",
    "Offline editing requires operation-specific full-resolution inputs; previews/metadata remain available.",
    "Portable native export includes required sources/layers/masks and optional history.",
    "Automatically prune oldest unprotected undo; preserve checkpoints/current referenced assets and warn on protected overflow.",
    "Recovery drafts have no expiry, remain until explicit Save/Discard and appear in Recoverable Drafts.",
    "Add to Catalog registers existing document in place with identity/history/source links and asks for a virtual folder.",
    "Color-managed RGB, wide gamut, selectable RGB exports and print soft-proofing; no native CMYK/spot-color prepress.",
    "16 GB minimum editing target; AI admission uses measured available unified-memory fit.",
    "First-class pen pressure, supported tilt, configurable response and tablet shortcuts.",
    "Signed/notarized direct download with user-controlled in-app updates.",
    "Visible background-AI pause at safe boundaries during painting/adjustment, then automatic resume.",
    "p95 1 s warm switch / 150 ms RAW preview / 50 ms brush display are goals for 24\u201350 MP and 20-layer fixtures; final limits approved after native prototype measurements in sc-24694."
